OL,3,GNEWSA'Mindless vandals' causing public
OL,4,Atoilet damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic toilets in a North Yorkshire
OL,7,Ftown are being blighted by a "sharp
OL,8,Frise" in vandalism and anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour, a councillor has said.
OL,11,FAccording to Knaresborough Town
OL,12,FCouncil's maintenance team, the
OL,13,Ffacilities at the bus station are being
OL,14,Ftargeted on an almost daily basis.
OL,16,FMatt Walker, who represents
OL,17,FKnaresborough West, described the
OL,18,Fdamage to the conveniences as
OL,19,F"disgusting".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
