OL,3,GNEWSA'Mindless vandals' causing public
OL,4,Atoilet damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a result of the recent vandalism the
OL,7,Ftoilets at the bus station are being
OL,8,Ftemporarily closed, and all public
OL,9,Fconveniences in the town will now close
OL,10,Fat 18:00.
